{"id":"8413d8d6c975b16c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/836_Arieli–Avron_双格逻辑.md","title":"836 Arieli–Avron 双格逻辑","display":"836_Arieli–Avron_双格逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。Arieli--Avron 双格逻辑语言构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf f,\\quad \\mathsf t,\\quad \\neg,\\quad -,\\quad\n\\wedge_t,\\quad \\vee_t,\\quad \\wedge_k,\\quad \\vee_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf f,\\quad \\mathsf t,\\quad \\neg,\\quad -,\\quad\n\\wedge_t,\\quad \\vee_t,\\quad \\wedge_k,\\quad \\vee_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>内部构造子的型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{false},\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{false},\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conf}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conf}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tmeet},\\operatorname{tjoin},\n\\operatorname{kmeet},\\operatorname{kjoin}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tmeet},\\operatorname{tjoin},\n\\operatorname{kmeet},\\operatorname{kjoin}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\">\\(-\\)</span> 为 conflation 构造子。无项、量词或绑定构造子。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{false}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{false}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conf}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{conf}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tjoin}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{tjoin}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{kmeet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{kmeet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{kjoin}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{kjoin}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一致性公式为派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\circ A:=\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,\\operatorname{conf}(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\circ A:=\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,\\operatorname{conf}(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{false})=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{true})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{false})=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{true})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{conf}(A))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\operatorname{conf}(A))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\{\\operatorname{tmeet},\\operatorname{tjoin},\\operatorname{kmeet},\\operatorname{kjoin}\\}\">\\(c\\in\\{\\operatorname{tmeet},\\operatorname{tjoin},\\operatorname{kmeet},\\operatorname{kjoin}\\}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(c(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(c(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，令\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\sigma)\\)</span>；它由下列子句唯一确定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{false})=\\operatorname{false},\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{true})=\\operatorname{true},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{false})=\\operatorname{false},\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{true})=\\operatorname{true},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{conf}(A))=\\operatorname{conf}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{conf}(A))=\\operatorname{conf}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(c(A,B))=c(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(c(A,B))=c(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{AA}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{AA}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由变元函数别名与替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 不需要 fresh 选择或捕获避免重命名；替换只按上述构造子递归。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-Arieli--Avron-双格\">4. Arieli--Avron 双格</h1>\n<p>Arieli--Avron 双格为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A=(A,\\le_t,\\le_k,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\bot,\\top,\n\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k,\\neg,-)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf A=(A,\\le_t,\\le_k,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\bot,\\top,\n\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k,\\neg,-)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\le_t,\\le_k\\ \\subseteq A^2,\\qquad\n\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\bot,\\top\\in A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\le_t,\\le_k\\ \\subseteq A^2,\\qquad\n\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\bot,\\top\\in A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k:A^2\\to A,\n\\qquad\n\\neg,-:A\\to A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k:A^2\\to A,\n\\qquad\n\\neg,-:A\\to A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列双格条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_t\">\\(\\le_t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_k\">\\(\\le_k\\)</span> 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上偏序。真序有界格为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\le_t,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\wedge_t,\\vee_t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\le_t,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf t,\\wedge_t,\\vee_t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in A\">\\(a,b,c\\in A\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_t b=b\\wedge_t a,\\quad\na\\vee_t b=b\\vee_t a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_t b=b\\wedge_t a,\\quad\na\\vee_t b=b\\vee_t a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge_t b)\\wedge_t c=a\\wedge_t(b\\wedge_t c),\\quad\n(a\\vee_t b)\\vee_t c=a\\vee_t(b\\vee_t c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge_t b)\\wedge_t c=a\\wedge_t(b\\wedge_t c),\\quad\n(a\\vee_t b)\\vee_t c=a\\vee_t(b\\vee_t c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_t(a\\vee_t b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee_t(a\\wedge_t b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_t(a\\vee_t b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee_t(a\\wedge_t b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf f\\le_t a,\\quad a\\le_t\\mathsf t,\\quad\na\\le_t b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge_t b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee_t b=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf f\\le_t a,\\quad a\\le_t\\mathsf t,\\quad\na\\le_t b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge_t b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee_t b=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>知识序有界格为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\le_k,\\bot,\\top,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\le_k,\\bot,\\top,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_k b=b\\wedge_k a,\\quad\na\\vee_k b=b\\vee_k a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_k b=b\\wedge_k a,\\quad\na\\vee_k b=b\\vee_k a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge_k b)\\wedge_k c=a\\wedge_k(b\\wedge_k c),\\quad\n(a\\vee_k b)\\vee_k c=a\\vee_k(b\\vee_k c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge_k b)\\wedge_k c=a\\wedge_k(b\\wedge_k c),\\quad\n(a\\vee_k b)\\vee_k c=a\\vee_k(b\\vee_k c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_k(a\\vee_k b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee_k(a\\wedge_k b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_k(a\\vee_k b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee_k(a\\wedge_k b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\le_k a,\\quad a\\le_k\\top,\\quad\na\\le_k b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge_k b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee_k b=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot\\le_k a,\\quad a\\le_k\\top,\\quad\na\\le_k b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge_k b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee_k b=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两套格运算相互单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_k c\\le_t b\\wedge_k c\n\\text{ 且 }\na\\vee_k c\\le_t b\\vee_k c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_k c\\le_t b\\wedge_k c\n\\text{ 且 }\na\\vee_k c\\le_t b\\vee_k c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_t c\\le_k b\\wedge_t c\n\\text{ 且 }\na\\vee_t c\\le_k b\\vee_t c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_t c\\le_k b\\wedge_t c\n\\text{ 且 }\na\\vee_t c\\le_k b\\vee_t c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg a=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\neg a=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow \\neg b\\le_t\\neg a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow \\neg b\\le_t\\neg a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow \\neg a\\le_k\\neg b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow \\neg a\\le_k\\neg b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且常元相容：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathsf f=\\mathsf t,\\quad\n\\neg\\mathsf t=\\mathsf f,\\quad\n\\neg\\bot=\\bot,\\quad\n\\neg\\top=\\top.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathsf f=\\mathsf t,\\quad\n\\neg\\mathsf t=\\mathsf f,\\quad\n\\neg\\bot=\\bot,\\quad\n\\neg\\top=\\top.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并额外满足 conflation 条件：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-(-a)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-(-a)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow -a\\le_t -b,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_t b\\Rightarrow -a\\le_t -b,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow -b\\le_k -a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_k b\\Rightarrow -b\\le_k -a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-(\\neg a)=\\neg(-a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-(\\neg a)=\\neg(-a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>作为格自同构/反自同构，conflation 的格方程为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-(a\\wedge_t b)=(-a)\\wedge_t(-b),\n\\quad\n-(a\\vee_t b)=(-a)\\vee_t(-b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-(a\\wedge_t b)=(-a)\\wedge_t(-b),\n\\quad\n-(a\\vee_t b)=(-a)\\vee_t(-b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-(a\\wedge_k b)=(-a)\\vee_k(-b),\n\\quad\n-(a\\vee_k b)=(-a)\\wedge_k(-b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-(a\\wedge_k b)=(-a)\\vee_k(-b),\n\\quad\n-(a\\vee_k b)=(-a)\\wedge_k(-b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此常元满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-\\mathsf f=\\mathsf f,\\qquad\n-\\mathsf t=\\mathsf t,\\qquad\n-\\bot=\\top,\\qquad\n-\\top=\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-\\mathsf f=\\mathsf f,\\qquad\n-\\mathsf t=\\mathsf t,\\qquad\n-\\bot=\\top,\\qquad\n-\\top=\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一个 Arieli--Avron 逻辑双格模型是二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\">\\(\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> 满足以上带 conflation 的双格条件，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是素双滤子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne F\\subsetneq A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\ne F\\subsetneq A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_t b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\land b\\in F),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_k b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\land b\\in F),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_t b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\land b\\in F),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_k b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\land b\\in F),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_t b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_k b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee_t b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_k b\\in F\\Longleftrightarrow(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathbf L}=F\">\\(D_{\\mathbf L}=F\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AALogBil}\">\\(\\mathsf{AALogBil}\\)</span> 为所有这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span>。指定值不再由退化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf t\\le_t a\">\\(\\mathsf t\\le_t a\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<p>目标差异是将 conflation 作为原始一元运算，并允许定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ A=A\\wedge_t -A\">\\(\\circ A=A\\wedge_t -A\\)</span>；每个模型还显式携带用于后承的素双滤子。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值递归\">5. 赋值递归</h1>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\">\\(\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\)</span>，则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=v(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=v(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{false}⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\mathsf f,\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{true}⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\mathsf t,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{false}⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\mathsf f,\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{true}⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\mathsf t,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{neg}(A)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\\neg⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{neg}(A)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\\neg⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{conf}(A)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=-⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{conf}(A)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=-⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\wedge_t\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{tmeet}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\wedge_t\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{tjoin}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\vee_t\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{tjoin}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\vee_t\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{kmeet}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\wedge_k\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{kmeet}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\wedge_k\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{kjoin}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\vee_k\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{kjoin}(A,B)⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\vee_k\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-有效式与后承\">6. 有效式与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\,\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\,\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义主后承关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>，定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}A\\)</span> 当且仅当对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\">\\(\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>定义 Arieli--Avron 赋值世界类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf L,v):\n\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil},\\ v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf L,v):\n\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil},\\ v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span> 一般是可定义类，反例对象按下式定义为\n该世界类的子类，而不对真类取幂集。对每个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf L,v):\n\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf L,v):\n\\mathbf L=(\\mathbf A,F)\\in\\mathsf{AALogBil},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L},\n\\quad\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\notin D_{\\mathbf L}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\n⟦ B⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\in D_{\\mathbf L},\n\\quad\n⟦ A⟧_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{AA}}\\notin D_{\\mathbf L}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{AA}}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目不定义非空证明对象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>Arieli--Avron 双格逻辑为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{AALogBil},\nD_{\\mathbf L},\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{AALogBil},\nD_{\\mathbf L},\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{World}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\)</span> 仅由本条目的带 conflation 逻辑双格、素双滤子、赋值递归和后承定义；不得把 Ginsberg 固定四值结构隐式加入。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法、命题替换、带 conflation 的双格类、指定值和语义后承；不含固定 Ginsberg 四值结构或证明论对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-Arieli--Avron-双格","text":"4. Arieli--Avron 双格","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值递归","text":"5. 赋值递归","level":1},{"id":"6.-有效式与后承","text":"6. 有效式与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf f,\\quad \\mathsf t,\\quad \\neg,\\quad -,\\quad\n\\wedge_t,\\quad \\vee_t,\\quad \\wedge_k,\\quad \\vee_k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{false},\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conf}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tmeet},\\operatorname{tjoin},\n\\operatorname{kmeet},\\operatorname{kjoin}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{false}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{true}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conf}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{AA}}","display":false},{"t